    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/f38b9474f751328c4278193d5cb80770.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span>Work your way through the mine as Sam, in an attempt to find your missing father. You'll need to blow up barricades and find parts to restore power to the many machines within the mine in order to progress through.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/2a862029104a8ec90477d5c95a9291fb.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure not to make too much noise! Many miners have lost their lives to the being that haunts the mine. You'll need to use your wit in order not to provoke her from her burrows. She might even hear you breathing!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/f70b82099c105144250f1920eb1b9521.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to dwell, get in, and get out. Don't become another lost soul in Jawbone Hollow!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/f38b9474f751328c4278193d5cb80770.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span>Work your way through the mine as Sam, in an attempt to find your missing father. You'll need to blow up barricades and find parts to restore power to the many machines within the mine in order to progress through.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/5da4dcab41703e072fa2029de3c78cdb.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/2a862029104a8ec90477d5c95a9291fb.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure not to make too much noise! Many miners have lost their lives to the being that haunts the mine. You'll need to use your wit in order not to provoke her from her burrows. She might even hear you breathing!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/1dc1f4f7f85379d4d0af64ef904e365f.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/f70b82099c105144250f1920eb1b9521.avif?t=1746138481\" data-has-big width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to dwell, get in, and get out. Don't become another lost soul in Jawbone Hollow!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.poster.avif?t=1746138481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.webm?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412800/extras/26b1dc624940aeaa6a4a98c55e59312c.mp4?t=1746138481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "We may be a small team, but we sure as hell have passion and drive. This single-player horror experience in a long-abandoned gold mine will make you go insane, wandering endlessly until death finally finds you. Misery awaits all who enter Jawbone Hollow. Do you think you can survive?",
